maluos-agent (0.3.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The task interface (Phase 12 slice 8): maluos_agent_tasks, JSON-RPC
    shaped like A2A (agent/card, tasks/send, tasks/get, tasks/list) on the
    agent's socket /run/maluos/agents/NAME/tasks.sock (the unit's runtime
    directory; MALUOS_AGENT_TASKS_SOCKET), admitting the owner, root and
    the agent by peer credentials. The demo agent serves it (each task is
    a question to the gateway). `maluctl agent card|send|tasks NAME` and
    `maluctl agent list --json`.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

maluos-agent (0.2.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Desk enrolment (Phase 12 slice 6): every maluos-agent@ unit and
    `maluctl agent run` load /etc/maluos/office.env when it exists, so
    agents see the office's endpoints (MALUOS_OFFICE_*) once the desk is
    enrolled.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:30:00 +0000

maluos-agent (0.2.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Ownership (Phase 12 slice 3): `--owner user:NAME` (default: the sudo
    user when enrolled; `--owner none` for a system agent). Recorded in
    the registry maluos_agent (maluos-vault 0.3.0 schema) and as
    MALUOS_AGENT_OWNER in the agent's env file; a polkit rule in
    /etc/polkit-1/rules.d lets the owner's session start, stop and restart
    the unit. list and show print the owner; remove retires the row and the
    rule.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:30:00 +0000

maluos-agent (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: maluctl agent create/list/show/run/start/stop/logs/remove,
    maluos-agent@.service template with standard and strict sandboxes, demo agent.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:30:00 +0000
